WEBVTT

00:00.007 --> 00:01.674
THIS IS A WORK OF FICTION. UNDERAGE
DRINKING IS STRONGLY PROHIBITED.

00:01.675 --> 00:03.343
FORCEFUL ALCOHOL CONSUMPTION AND
SHAMEFUL ACTS ARE NOT ENCOURAGED.

00:03.344 --> 00:04.970
VIEW THIS AS A COMEDY. ALL CHARACTERS
APPEARING IN THIS WORK ARE OF LEGAL AGE.

00:10.267 --> 00:11.643
You okay?

00:11.644 --> 00:14.980
Y-Yeah, just a few
small scratches.

00:15.314 --> 00:16.106
I see.

00:16.649 --> 00:18.734
And you?

00:19.485 --> 00:21.570
- What the hell is this situation?
- What the hell is this situation?

00:28.285 --> 00:31.913
<i>Let's ride out into the
highway of our youth</i>

00:31.914 --> 00:34.917
<i>Right now is always
the best of the season</i>

00:35.125 --> 00:38.586
<i>Get high on hope, as
we adults keep winning</i>

00:38.587 --> 00:42.131
<i>Let's take a dive to explore
an entirely new world</i>

00:42.132 --> 00:45.426
GRAND BLUE DREAMING SEASON 2

00:45.427 --> 00:47.555
<i>Ever Endless</i>

00:48.764 --> 00:50.432
<i>Ever Endless</i>

00:52.184 --> 00:53.727
<i>Ever Endless</i>

00:55.604 --> 00:56.981
<i>Ever Endless</i>

00:57.648 --> 01:02.443
<i>Mon-Tues-Weds-Thurs-Fri,
my life knows no variety</i>

01:02.444 --> 01:03.863
<i>Ever Endless</i>

01:04.280 --> 01:09.075
<i>Sat-Sun, wake up in the afternoon
with only my smartphone to surf</i>

01:09.076 --> 01:10.660
<i>Ever Endless</i>

01:10.661 --> 01:12.078
<i>All my limbs' been giving in</i>

01:12.079 --> 01:13.913
<i>Kalbi's a burden
like my lumber spine</i>

01:13.914 --> 01:15.498
<i>Doing family
service with irises dim</i>

01:15.499 --> 01:17.126
<i>But you know that
I'll go all the way</i>

01:17.543 --> 01:20.713
<i>Glitter, shimmer,
the light's shining</i>

01:21.005 --> 01:24.549
<i>Let's give it one more chance</i>

01:24.550 --> 01:28.012
<i>Let's ride out into the
highway of our youth</i>

01:28.220 --> 01:31.015
<i>Right now is always
the best of the season</i>

01:31.223 --> 01:34.851
<i>Get high on hope, as
we adults keep winning</i>

01:34.852 --> 01:37.855
<i>Let's take a dive to explore
an entirely new world</i>

01:38.105 --> 01:40.231
<i>Youth is when you never...</i>

01:40.232 --> 01:41.733
<i>stop chasing your own values</i>

01:41.734 --> 01:43.401
<i>Our youth's eternal</i>

01:43.402 --> 01:44.986
<i>the color never fades with age</i>

01:44.987 --> 01:46.863
<i>Youth is when you keep...</i>

01:46.864 --> 01:48.406
<i>getting lost along the way</i>

01:48.407 --> 01:51.952
<i>Youth is Forever</i>

01:58.500 --> 01:59.876
Oh, you're back.

01:59.877 --> 02:01.294
Where did you run off to?

02:01.295 --> 02:02.796
Just did a little hunting.

02:03.380 --> 02:04.923
And what about... Kitahara-san?

02:04.924 --> 02:06.800
I couldn't get a clean kill.

02:06.967 --> 02:09.178
I wasn't asking
about your hunt...

02:10.137 --> 02:12.138
Don't know what
he did this time,

02:12.139 --> 02:13.973
but it seems he
escaped in one piece.

02:13.974 --> 02:16.644
He probably won't come back
until Chisa-chan cools down.

02:16.894 --> 02:19.647
But it's pitch black out there.

02:20.231 --> 02:21.899
I'll go look for him.

02:22.274 --> 02:23.651
Then take this.

02:23.817 --> 02:26.195
When you find him,
finish him off for me.

02:26.403 --> 02:28.697
I'll... try my best.

02:29.865 --> 02:32.116
Doesn't seem like
we'll be climbing out.

02:32.117 --> 02:33.076
No kidding.

02:33.077 --> 02:33.993
Got your phone?

02:33.994 --> 02:36.080
Left it in the tent.
What about you?

02:36.830 --> 02:37.957
See for yourself.

02:38.123 --> 02:39.166
Seriously?

02:39.416 --> 02:41.961
So our only move is to sit
here and wait for rescue?

02:42.127 --> 02:43.546
Guess so.

02:43.921 --> 02:45.547
By the way, what you just did...

02:45.548 --> 02:46.465
What?

02:46.590 --> 02:50.594
Why didn't you think of calling
someone before you jumped down?

02:51.136 --> 02:52.595
Shut up.

02:52.596 --> 02:57.101
If I'd know it was you, I
wouldn't have rushed down.

02:57.518 --> 02:58.226
Oh.

02:58.227 --> 03:00.980
Do you think I was your
girlfriend or something?

03:02.064 --> 03:03.398
What makes you say that?

03:03.399 --> 03:05.775
Because you just jumped
straight down a cliff.

03:05.776 --> 03:07.819
It'd take someone special
to make you do that.

03:07.820 --> 03:08.654
Tsk.

03:08.988 --> 03:12.074
Sucks that you mistook me
for your precious girlfriend.

03:13.284 --> 03:15.368
Huh?! What was I supposed to do?

03:15.369 --> 03:17.329
There was a shoe
right by the ledge.

03:18.247 --> 03:21.876
And you were sprawled
out at the bottom like this!

03:23.043 --> 03:24.837
Kitahara-san!

03:30.551 --> 03:33.470
Kitahara-san!

03:37.308 --> 03:38.683
My bad.

03:38.684 --> 03:40.895
As long as you're okay.

03:42.271 --> 03:44.898
I should've called for help
instead of jumping down.

03:44.899 --> 03:47.066
My mind kinda went blank.

03:47.067 --> 03:49.987
I'm just happy you
came looking for me.

03:50.696 --> 03:52.030
What's with that toy?

03:52.031 --> 03:56.075
Because Chisa-san kept trying
to make me take a harpoon along.

03:56.076 --> 03:57.369
So I fooled her with this.

03:57.786 --> 03:59.997
See, I have it right here.

04:01.707 --> 04:03.626
<i>She is still pissed, huh?</i>

04:05.044 --> 04:07.004
Huh? What's this button do?

04:07.504 --> 04:08.880
"Unbalance the balance!"

04:08.881 --> 04:10.299
"Extinguish the sea!"

04:10.758 --> 04:12.467
"Swing the magical stick!"

04:12.468 --> 04:14.135
Looks like it's voiced.

04:14.136 --> 04:16.554
This kinda thing's
right up Kouhei's alley...

04:16.555 --> 04:20.267
L-L-Lalako-tan!

04:22.394 --> 04:24.104
Why the hell would
you show up for?

04:24.939 --> 04:28.859
I heard Lalako-tan's voice
and my mind just went blank.

04:29.443 --> 04:31.529
Well at least we're saved.

04:32.071 --> 04:32.946
Huh?

04:32.947 --> 04:34.113
Y'all got phones, right?

04:34.114 --> 04:35.698
Mine's dead.

04:35.699 --> 04:36.824
Actually, mine too.

04:36.825 --> 04:40.329
Huh, so the wait continues.

04:40.579 --> 04:41.955
I'm sorry.

04:41.956 --> 04:44.249
You can't scale this?

04:44.250 --> 04:45.375
Stop saying bullshit.

04:45.376 --> 04:47.377
I guess it can't be helped.

04:47.378 --> 04:48.586
Yup.

04:48.587 --> 04:50.880
Let's just start a fire for now.

04:50.881 --> 04:51.674
- Huh?
- Eh?

04:55.177 --> 04:57.388
Why are you carrying a lighter?

04:57.555 --> 04:59.556
To test which "water"
is flammable, duh.

04:59.557 --> 05:01.058
Who needs to do that?

05:01.684 --> 05:03.226
Yo. I'm back.

05:03.227 --> 05:05.186
This should probably be enough.

05:05.187 --> 05:07.397
Find anything besides firewood?

05:07.398 --> 05:08.357
Yes.

05:08.816 --> 05:10.067
I found some air potatoes.

05:10.317 --> 05:12.236
Also some wild
shiitake mushrooms.

05:12.695 --> 05:13.988
And some wild whiskey.

05:14.238 --> 05:16.489
Nice find, Kitahara.

05:16.490 --> 05:18.283
Hold up, you guys.

05:18.284 --> 05:21.328
Someone must have dropped it.

05:23.789 --> 05:25.874
That'll do for the
shiitake mushrooms.

05:25.875 --> 05:27.125
Looking good.

05:27.126 --> 05:29.336
If only we had some soy sauce.

05:29.503 --> 05:31.213
How should we
cook the air potatoes?

05:31.547 --> 05:34.216
They'll burn if we
toss them in the fire.

05:34.425 --> 05:35.801
That's true.

05:36.177 --> 05:39.053
Let's look for a
slab to grill them on.

05:39.054 --> 05:40.138
I see.

05:40.139 --> 05:41.015
Good idea.

05:41.307 --> 05:43.850
I'm amazed you guys
are into this situation.

05:43.851 --> 05:45.477
Don't get the wrong idea.

05:47.396 --> 05:51.275
Leave your memories
and your life right there!

05:51.775 --> 05:54.028
It'd be more
dangerous if I go back.

05:54.570 --> 05:56.488
What the hell did you do?

05:57.656 --> 06:00.783
Oh right, Chisa-san
was pretty mad.

06:00.784 --> 06:02.785
What happened this time?

06:02.786 --> 06:03.746
Well...

06:05.289 --> 06:06.665
it's a long story.

06:07.958 --> 06:11.170
Can't brush it off like I
would with my sister, huh?

06:13.547 --> 06:15.507
Well, let's give them a try.

06:15.508 --> 06:16.509
Sounds good.

06:16.717 --> 06:17.634
- Here, eat up.
- Here, eat up.

06:17.635 --> 06:19.220
Why should I
take the first bite?

06:19.470 --> 06:20.595
What's with the fuss?

06:20.596 --> 06:23.556
Cause there is one
mushroom that looks poisonous!

06:23.557 --> 06:24.683
Like hell I'd trust you.

06:24.850 --> 06:26.309
Then help yourself to those.

06:26.310 --> 06:27.727
You don't have to tell me.

06:27.728 --> 06:29.647
Let's eat.

06:32.358 --> 06:33.274
- It's delicious!
- It's delicious!

06:33.275 --> 06:34.442
It's very good.

06:34.443 --> 06:36.069
So disgusting!

06:36.070 --> 06:37.488
What the hell is this flavor?

06:38.989 --> 06:42.368
Air potatoes are
still bitter this season.

06:42.868 --> 06:45.204
They're only edible in the fall.

06:45.538 --> 06:47.540
This is all we've got to drink.

06:48.374 --> 06:49.041
Give it here.

06:51.085 --> 06:52.669
Good chugging!

06:52.670 --> 06:54.088
What a man!

06:57.883 --> 06:59.717
There's something
I'm curious about.

06:59.718 --> 07:00.677
Huh?

07:00.678 --> 07:03.514
Why'd you back
down so easily today?

07:03.639 --> 07:04.890
That's true.

07:05.891 --> 07:07.601
Shut up.

07:07.893 --> 07:10.354
I was just being thoughtful
of Tokita and the others.

07:10.479 --> 07:11.145
Huh?

07:11.146 --> 07:12.314
What's with that?

07:12.439 --> 07:15.484
You guys probably don't get
it since you're still freshmen.

07:16.110 --> 07:19.154
But we third-years
have to step down soon.

07:19.780 --> 07:21.197
Step down?

07:21.198 --> 07:22.867
But you still have
all of senior year.

07:23.075 --> 07:25.870
We're gonna do graduation
thesis and go job hunting.

07:26.829 --> 07:30.708
I didn't want to cut into the
time they have left with you guys.

07:33.460 --> 07:36.796
Sorry, an outsider like me
shouldn't have come along.

07:36.797 --> 07:39.632
Not at all, I'm the
one who invited you.

07:39.633 --> 07:41.385
Besides, we're diving buddies.

07:42.511 --> 07:45.013
So, you guys got
anything planned?

07:45.014 --> 07:46.098
What do you mean?

07:46.390 --> 07:48.267
Like a
passing-of-the-torch event.

07:48.475 --> 07:50.477
Usually, the second-years
would make a plan.

07:50.686 --> 07:52.854
Our club doesn't have
any second-years.

07:52.855 --> 07:53.938
Is that so?

07:53.939 --> 07:56.567
And there are
only four freshmen.

07:56.734 --> 07:58.776
The upperclassmen
are stepping down, huh?

07:58.777 --> 08:00.821
I can't even imagine that.

08:00.946 --> 08:01.989
I'm sure...

08:02.656 --> 08:05.826
that just shows how
much fun you're having.

08:07.745 --> 08:08.953
Fun?

08:08.954 --> 08:11.540
Feels like I have more
painful memories than anything.

08:13.209 --> 08:17.046
If you can't imagine
it, then so be it.

08:17.379 --> 08:20.508
But keep in mind that
there's not much time left...

08:24.345 --> 08:25.637
Hey, don't fall asleep.

08:25.638 --> 08:26.346
Huh?

08:26.347 --> 08:29.058
Tell us more about the
passing-of-the-torch thing.

08:29.517 --> 08:31.810
Who knows what PaB does.

08:33.687 --> 08:35.897
Otoya-kun, do you know anything?

08:35.898 --> 08:38.024
Our club also sends
off the upperclassmen.

08:38.025 --> 08:39.777
As expected of a diving club.

08:40.152 --> 08:43.196
We showed them an underwater
flag during our summer training camp.

08:43.197 --> 08:44.197
THANK YOU FOR TAKING
CARE OF US A flag, huh?

08:44.198 --> 08:46.408
THANK YOU FOR TAKING CARE
OF US Makes sense for a diving club.

08:46.617 --> 08:49.160
So now we just need
to pick a nice spot.

08:49.161 --> 08:49.994
Right.

08:49.995 --> 08:51.080
Hey!

08:51.830 --> 08:53.707
There you guys are.

08:53.916 --> 08:55.376
We've been looking everywhere.

08:55.584 --> 08:56.709
Oh!

08:56.710 --> 08:59.797
- We're saved!
- Thank you!

09:09.557 --> 09:11.307
Are you two going snorkeling?

09:11.308 --> 09:12.016
Yes.

09:12.017 --> 09:15.103
I'd catch a fish to
present to Kaya-sama.

09:15.104 --> 09:18.065
Yesterday, Chisa
said she'd go too, but...

09:18.440 --> 09:20.567
- Oh my.
- It can't be helped then.

09:20.568 --> 09:21.986
No doubt.

09:22.319 --> 09:24.696
Care to join us, Azusa-san?

09:24.697 --> 09:25.864
Sure.

09:25.865 --> 09:28.117
Actually, since we're
going swimming and all...

09:28.325 --> 09:31.035
let's dive off the levee
and take a picture.

09:31.036 --> 09:32.496
A picture?

09:32.872 --> 09:34.247
You mean like this?

09:34.248 --> 09:36.125
No, that's not it.

09:36.876 --> 09:40.880
I mean the one with Nanaka after the
force from landing knocks her top off, duh.

09:41.088 --> 09:43.090
<i>Such pure eyes.</i>

09:44.258 --> 09:46.385
<i>Purely reflect lustfulness.</i>

09:46.844 --> 09:48.636
Is that okay, Azusa-san?

09:48.637 --> 09:51.515
Won't your top come off too?

09:51.724 --> 09:53.267
Huh?

09:53.767 --> 09:54.767
So what?

09:54.768 --> 09:56.979
<i>- Oh gosh! How manly!
- Oh gosh! How manly!</i>

09:57.897 --> 10:00.565
Come on, let's go get Nanaka!

10:00.566 --> 10:01.984
- Yes sir!
- Yes sir!

10:02.902 --> 10:04.652
Are you all diving
off the levee?

10:04.653 --> 10:05.403
Yes.

10:05.404 --> 10:06.237
Mhm, mhm.

10:06.238 --> 10:07.990
I see.

10:08.365 --> 10:09.824
Let's give it a try.

10:09.825 --> 10:11.118
- Hell yeah!
- Hell yeah!

10:11.368 --> 10:13.037
By the way, how is Chisa?

10:13.245 --> 10:15.748
A little better. She's
sleeping right now.

10:15.915 --> 10:17.291
That's great.

10:21.170 --> 10:23.046
So, are we taking a
picture as we jump?

10:23.047 --> 10:23.963
Correct.

10:23.964 --> 10:25.925
Just take a plunge,
don't hesitate.

10:26.050 --> 10:28.176
Taking a photo while
diving off the levee?

10:28.177 --> 10:29.719
Sounds fun.

10:29.720 --> 10:30.304
Ugh!

10:30.596 --> 10:31.346
What's wrong?

10:31.347 --> 10:33.097
We can't be in it?

10:33.098 --> 10:33.806
Ah, no...

10:33.807 --> 10:35.016
It's just...

10:35.017 --> 10:36.977
<i>We already know
how it will turn out.</i>

10:37.937 --> 10:40.230
We should all take one together.

10:40.231 --> 10:41.105
Okay.

10:41.106 --> 10:42.607
What pose should I do?

10:42.608 --> 10:44.527
I wanna do a triple flip.

10:45.319 --> 10:46.028
Hmm.

10:46.278 --> 10:47.070
Azusa-san.

10:47.071 --> 10:48.655
We leave the rest to you.

10:48.656 --> 10:49.281
Huh?

10:49.657 --> 10:50.740
Iori Kitahara!

10:50.741 --> 10:52.117
Kouhei Imamura!

10:52.284 --> 10:53.994
- Let's charge!
- Let's charge!

11:04.797 --> 11:06.506
That seems kind of dangerous.

11:06.507 --> 11:07.674
Yeah.

11:07.675 --> 11:08.424
No way.

11:08.425 --> 11:10.177
Were our efforts in vain?

11:10.386 --> 11:12.345
Alright, our turn.

11:12.346 --> 11:14.098
Let's get a good
shot with you two.

11:15.391 --> 11:17.059
Heave ho!

11:18.310 --> 11:20.228
Looks like they're
all having fun.

11:20.229 --> 11:21.605
Yeah.

11:21.814 --> 11:25.733
When I enter college, I want
to join a club like that too.

11:25.734 --> 11:26.609
Ah...

11:26.610 --> 11:29.530
- You might want to reconsider that one.
- Triple...

11:30.614 --> 11:31.699
Flip!

11:31.866 --> 11:33.950
I'll do a triple flip next!

11:33.951 --> 11:34.910
Oh.

11:35.077 --> 11:36.035
Quintuple...

11:36.036 --> 11:37.036
Say what?!

11:37.037 --> 11:38.246
flip!

11:38.247 --> 11:40.415
Alright, all is set.

11:40.416 --> 11:42.125
What's up, Sakurako?

11:42.126 --> 11:42.960
It's nothing.

11:48.048 --> 11:50.049
The island was really fun.

11:50.050 --> 11:51.301
I'm glad we got to come.

11:51.302 --> 11:52.468
That's right.

11:52.469 --> 11:55.014
I'll have to thank the
guest who reserved for us

11:59.310 --> 12:00.977
Iori-kun, what's wrong?

12:00.978 --> 12:01.519
Huh?

12:01.520 --> 12:02.687
Didn't you have fun?

12:02.688 --> 12:04.230
No, that's not it.

12:04.231 --> 12:05.774
I had a great time.

12:06.317 --> 12:09.027
I was just thinking
about things.

12:09.028 --> 12:10.237
About what?

12:10.529 --> 12:12.865
Well, a lot happened last night.

12:13.908 --> 12:16.869
You sound like a young
man who's been through a lot.

12:17.161 --> 12:19.037
So, what's up?
Relationship problem?

12:19.038 --> 12:20.789
I guess you could say that.

12:21.790 --> 12:26.086
Deep down, I thought our
relationship would never change.

12:26.378 --> 12:28.005
But then I realized...

12:29.715 --> 12:32.635
<i>We third-years have
to step down soon.</i>

12:33.177 --> 12:35.846
things can't stay
this way forever.

12:36.597 --> 12:38.097
Sounds like an
anime character...

12:38.098 --> 12:40.976
who realizes he's in love
with his childhood friend.

12:42.061 --> 12:44.188
<i>Don't tell me Iori...</i>

12:44.855 --> 12:46.941
<i>has feelings for me?</i>

12:47.775 --> 12:49.026
<i>Because of that?</i>

12:52.530 --> 12:53.947
We're home.

12:53.948 --> 12:54.990
I'm home.

12:55.115 --> 12:56.574
You're taking a bath, right?

12:56.575 --> 12:57.910
I'll get it ready.

12:58.244 --> 12:59.662
Thank you.

13:00.120 --> 13:01.997
Should we start
preparing dinner?

13:03.415 --> 13:04.207
What's wrong?

13:04.208 --> 13:05.501
I-It's nothing.

13:05.668 --> 13:07.169
I'm going to get changed first.

13:07.378 --> 13:08.295
Sure.

13:09.630 --> 13:10.713
I'm back.

13:10.714 --> 13:12.675
<i>Something's definitely up.</i>

13:15.177 --> 13:16.845
Chisa, hand me the ladle.

13:16.846 --> 13:17.555
Here.

13:21.267 --> 13:22.226
You want this plate?

13:22.518 --> 13:23.310
Here...

13:23.727 --> 13:25.271
Chisa, pass me the salt.

13:26.021 --> 13:26.896
Thank you.

13:26.897 --> 13:28.107
Chisa, taste this...

13:29.066 --> 13:29.816
I'm good.

13:29.817 --> 13:30.568
Chisa.

13:30.985 --> 13:31.526
What?

13:31.527 --> 13:33.946
<i>She's clearly acting weird.</i>

13:34.446 --> 13:36.740
<i>The only reason I can
think of is that mishap.</i>

13:38.367 --> 13:41.579
<i>But she doesn't seem angry.</i>

13:42.246 --> 13:46.041
<i>I wanted to talk about
throwing a send off for the guys.</i>

13:46.375 --> 13:47.918
Hmm...

13:56.719 --> 13:58.345
Yeah? That you, sis?

13:58.679 --> 13:59.638
Nope, it's me.

14:02.141 --> 14:03.309
What do you want?

14:03.601 --> 14:05.519
I need to talk to you.

14:05.769 --> 14:06.936
Mind if I open the door...

14:06.937 --> 14:08.230
Absolutely not!

14:08.898 --> 14:10.608
<i>I didn't even finish.</i>

14:10.941 --> 14:12.317
Something trivial again?

14:12.318 --> 14:14.570
Ah, well...

14:14.820 --> 14:18.407
<i>Looks like playing it cool
won't get me anywhere.</i>

14:19.325 --> 14:21.409
Actually, it's very important.

14:21.410 --> 14:22.660
Then it's an even bigger no!

14:22.661 --> 14:23.579
Why is that?

14:24.455 --> 14:27.666
<i>Guess I gotta patch
things up between us first.</i>

14:29.168 --> 14:30.126
Hey Chisa...

14:30.127 --> 14:31.921
I don't want to hear it.

14:33.964 --> 14:36.090
Want to go boat diving tomorrow?

14:36.091 --> 14:39.637
Do you think I'm
such a pushover?

14:42.389 --> 14:43.598
Seriously.

14:43.599 --> 14:45.100
<i>But she still took that bait.</i>

14:45.267 --> 14:46.476
Just so you know,

14:46.477 --> 14:48.978
I won't talk about anything
that's not diving related.

14:48.979 --> 14:51.607
Why are you so wary of me?

14:52.441 --> 14:54.275
I just want to talk about...

14:54.276 --> 14:55.277
Hey, you two.

14:55.528 --> 14:58.239
We're diving with some
customers today, okay?

15:02.576 --> 15:03.576
A fishing boat?

15:03.577 --> 15:07.413
To go boat diving in this area,
we get fishermen to take us out.

15:07.414 --> 15:08.499
Huh...

15:11.794 --> 15:14.128
Going by fishing boat
is actually quite fun.

15:14.129 --> 15:16.506
I'm pretty used to it.

15:16.507 --> 15:17.715
The weather is nice too.

15:17.716 --> 15:18.425
Yeah.

15:20.511 --> 15:21.971
By the way, about
the other day...

15:26.392 --> 15:28.935
I was thinking about
getting my own pair of fins.

15:28.936 --> 15:31.145
In that case, there's a
new pair that just came out.

15:31.146 --> 15:32.480
And a diving computer too.

15:32.481 --> 15:34.274
It depends on your budget,

15:34.275 --> 15:36.276
but some of them
work with your phone.

15:36.277 --> 15:37.987
And I need your advice on...

15:40.781 --> 15:42.992
<i>What's deal with this?</i>

15:43.659 --> 15:46.579
<i>I don't think it's just
because I saw her boobs.</i>

15:47.705 --> 15:48.539
<i>Wait a minute.</i>

15:48.747 --> 15:51.375
<i>She was acting
weird even before that.</i>

15:52.126 --> 15:54.211
<i>Chisa, on the
uninhabited island you...</i>

15:59.466 --> 16:00.718
<i>Geez.</i>

16:00.885 --> 16:03.262
<i>I have no idea what
she's so hung up on.</i>

16:03.637 --> 16:06.765
<i>But some diving should
get her back to normal.</i>

16:09.101 --> 16:12.688
Alright everyone, please
assemble by the buoy.

16:12.897 --> 16:14.190
Okay!

16:22.865 --> 16:23.908
Mmm, okay.

16:24.074 --> 16:26.327
Oh, then let me check for you.

16:29.455 --> 16:31.081
I'm all set.

16:32.374 --> 16:33.917
See you at the buoy then.

16:33.918 --> 16:34.627
Yeah.

16:39.089 --> 16:40.591
<i>Oh.</i>

16:41.967 --> 16:44.136
<i>The water is really clear.</i>

16:45.095 --> 16:47.306
<i>This should cheer her up.</i>

16:48.474 --> 16:50.601
<i>Chisa? She isn't coming down?</i>

16:50.768 --> 16:52.728
<i>Huh? She's going
back to the boat?</i>

16:52.937 --> 16:54.772
<i>She's not diving?</i>

16:56.482 --> 16:57.650
Chisa, what's wrong?

16:58.275 --> 17:00.235
Nothing! Just go away!

17:00.236 --> 17:01.153
As if!

17:01.570 --> 17:03.739
Something must be
wrong if you can't...

17:04.365 --> 17:05.658
Here, Chisa-chan.

17:05.824 --> 17:06.492
Huh?

17:06.784 --> 17:07.618
Chisa...

17:08.285 --> 17:10.037
It's... nothing...

17:10.371 --> 17:13.040
I just forgot my weight belt.

17:13.666 --> 17:15.376
You can't dive without it.

17:54.081 --> 17:58.543
Who'd have thought you'd
forget your weight belt.

17:58.544 --> 18:00.086
Shut up, Iori.

18:00.087 --> 18:02.046
It's because you
get distracted...

18:02.047 --> 18:04.341
and then slack off
on the buddy check.

18:04.717 --> 18:06.260
I learned my lesson.

18:06.468 --> 18:08.846
So? Why were you
so distracted, anyway?

18:10.806 --> 18:11.974
Oh...

18:12.349 --> 18:14.476
GUIDE FOR BEGINNER
DIVERS That attitude again?

18:15.060 --> 18:18.939
Neglecting a safety check
endangers your diving buddy.

18:19.440 --> 18:21.901
Sure that's good manners
for an aspiring instructor?

18:25.529 --> 18:26.864
Seriously.

18:27.907 --> 18:30.367
I won't make fun of
you, so just talk to me.

18:38.626 --> 18:40.668
Iori, you...

18:40.669 --> 18:41.462
Yeah?

18:43.047 --> 18:44.590
Do you...

18:45.257 --> 18:46.467
love me?

18:47.968 --> 18:48.886
<i>Feels like...</i>

18:49.220 --> 18:51.597
<i>I've been asked a
similar question before.</i>

18:51.889 --> 18:53.264
<i>Do you love boobs?</i>

18:53.265 --> 18:54.850
<i>Yeah, I love the right one.</i>

18:56.101 --> 18:56.977
Of course I do!

18:57.436 --> 18:59.396
Huh? Uh... Wait...
The thing is...

19:00.147 --> 19:03.399
I have to call
Azusa-san real quick...

19:03.400 --> 19:04.818
Whoa, whoa, whoa, hold it!

19:05.277 --> 19:07.946
This is clearly some kind of
massive misunderstanding!

19:07.947 --> 19:09.156
But... but...

19:09.281 --> 19:12.033
you just said you loved me.

19:12.034 --> 19:12.660
Huh?

19:13.327 --> 19:15.037
Me? Loved you?

19:16.121 --> 19:18.082
What gave you that idea?

19:18.457 --> 19:19.708
Because...

19:20.167 --> 19:22.585
of what happened in
the tent the other day.

19:22.586 --> 19:26.257
And on the boat back, you said
you were having feelings for me.

19:28.467 --> 19:31.219
So, because I accidentally
saw your boobs the other day...

19:31.220 --> 19:34.431
you thought I started
to see you as a woman?

19:36.559 --> 19:39.477
Sigh, listen here.

19:39.478 --> 19:40.645
W-What?

19:40.646 --> 19:42.564
If that were all it took,

19:42.565 --> 19:45.401
then what about all the
times you've seen me naked?

19:46.944 --> 19:50.154
But that was the first time
it was the other way around.

19:50.155 --> 19:52.074
Well, that's true.

19:52.324 --> 19:53.951
They're amazingly
nice tits, too.

19:56.078 --> 19:58.329
So we're even now?

19:58.330 --> 20:00.541
Fine, but I'm still mad.

20:00.791 --> 20:04.545
But you don't have to stress
over it when it comes to me.

20:04.920 --> 20:08.506
True, it seems stupid getting worked
up over anything to do with you.

20:08.507 --> 20:10.717
Wait, you don't
have to go that far.

20:10.718 --> 20:11.426
But...

20:11.427 --> 20:12.093
Huh?

20:12.094 --> 20:16.432
You're just about
everywhere I go these days.

20:17.892 --> 20:19.726
I guess that's true.

20:19.727 --> 20:20.728
So...

20:21.145 --> 20:23.397
the idea of you
having feelings for me,

20:23.522 --> 20:26.066
I can't possibly imagine
a huge change like that.

20:30.696 --> 20:32.655
<i>The upperclassmen
are stepping down, huh?</i>

20:32.656 --> 20:34.700
<i>I can't imagine it.</i>

20:34.950 --> 20:39.079
<i>I'm sure that just shows
how much fun you're having.</i>

20:40.414 --> 20:41.289
I see.

20:41.290 --> 20:41.956
What is it?

20:41.957 --> 20:42.958
It's nothing.

20:43.542 --> 20:47.087
I was just thinking you must
be enjoying life right now too.

20:47.546 --> 20:48.255
Huh?

20:48.714 --> 20:50.966
Can you try making sense?

20:52.760 --> 20:54.345
Sorry about that.

20:58.140 --> 21:01.226
By the way, what were
you trying to talk about?

21:01.227 --> 21:03.145
Oh, right.

21:03.312 --> 21:05.481
It's about the
upperclassmen's send-off event.

21:06.398 --> 21:09.235
So I figured what better
way than to go diving, right?

21:09.360 --> 21:11.362
So that's what you
wanted to talk about.

21:11.612 --> 21:14.531
Why didn't you just say so?

21:14.532 --> 21:16.867
That's not freaking
fair you know!

21:17.076 --> 21:19.536
Last year, everyone
did it in Okinawa.

21:19.537 --> 21:21.246
But we already
went there this year.

21:21.247 --> 21:22.664
That's right.

21:22.665 --> 21:24.250
So why not go all out...

21:24.416 --> 21:26.335
and do something overseas?

21:26.627 --> 21:28.045
Overseas, huh?

21:29.004 --> 21:31.507
Could I get in the water
with my current license?

21:31.757 --> 21:33.592
Sure you can.

21:33.717 --> 21:36.595
But you should try and get your
advanced license just to be safe.

21:37.137 --> 21:39.640
Alright, then I'll go for it.

21:39.807 --> 21:40.641
Really?

21:40.891 --> 21:43.185
If Kouhei and Cakey
are on board, that is.

21:43.435 --> 21:46.397
I think they'd be
up to get theirs.

21:57.408 --> 21:58.576
Hello?

22:01.787 --> 22:03.289
Long time no see.

22:05.291 --> 22:06.458
Mom.

22:14.717 --> 22:16.259
<i>Wanna talk to you,
wanna talk to you</i>

22:16.260 --> 22:18.136
<i>First I gotta know all
about you, isn't that right?</i>

22:18.137 --> 22:20.096
<i>Ending it off at round
one reeks of boredom</i>

22:20.097 --> 22:21.848
<i>Rounds two, three,
and four is the plan</i>

22:21.849 --> 22:23.558
<i>As the night gets deeper,
true thoughts escape</i>

22:23.559 --> 22:25.476
<i>Let us go on and on
and dive down late</i>

22:25.477 --> 22:28.479
<i>Your history, your scenery, for
me will your pages get slippery</i>

22:28.480 --> 22:30.523
<i>Hey, show me even more</i>

22:30.524 --> 22:32.275
<i>This is my track and
you are the featured guest</i>

22:32.276 --> 22:33.860
<i>We'll forget by the
time when the dawn hits</i>

22:33.861 --> 22:35.320
<i>Being incomplete is perfection</i>

22:35.321 --> 22:37.572
<i>Hey, show me even more</i>

22:37.573 --> 22:39.157
<i>My mouth keeps slipping,
my mouth keeps slipping</i>

22:39.158 --> 22:40.783
<i>Complaint whether
we sober upward</i>

22:40.784 --> 22:42.828
<i>For now, let's ride
high on this feeling</i>

22:43.204 --> 22:49.251
<i>Let's live this moment with all we
can without leaving a single regret,</i>

22:49.752 --> 22:51.461
<i>We are gonna do it,
we go past the limit now</i>

22:51.462 --> 22:53.087
<i>Not just the whole night,
party till the sun is out</i>

22:53.088 --> 22:55.256
<i>Let's fly high</i>

22:55.257 --> 22:55.840
<i>(Let's fly high)</i>

22:55.841 --> 22:57.842
<i>So first, you just strip it down</i>

22:57.843 --> 23:00.136
<i>An exposed and
feral kind of bond</i>

23:00.137 --> 23:03.765
<i>It's the way of life's cycle,
let us go way beyond</i>

23:03.766 --> 23:05.391
<i>The very moment that
we met I drop my shy act</i>

23:05.392 --> 23:07.143
<i>I wanna bare it all and
say what I need to say</i>

23:07.144 --> 23:09.146
<i>Do it now...</i>

23:09.939 --> 23:14.234
<i>This is the magic spell that breaks
down each and every single wall</i>

23:14.235 --> 23:17.695
<i>And once you get used to
it, you won't feel a thing at all</i>

23:17.696 --> 23:19.197
<i>Being without clothes
is a mystery I live in</i>

23:19.198 --> 23:20.949
<i>The drinking and chatting
is flowing more freely</i>

23:20.950 --> 23:23.327
<i>Try it now...</i>

23:23.744 --> 23:27.247
<i>And right before you
realize what's going on</i>

23:27.248 --> 23:31.460
<i>Your heart will catch
right up and finally be free</i>

